	ISZ	CALLF0	/BUMP PAST ROUTINE ADDR
	DCA	SUBRTN
	CDF		/SET DF TO OUR FIELD
	TAD	ACARG	/GET CALLING AC
	JMS I	SUBRTN	/CALL THE ROUTINE
	SKP		/ALLOW SKIP RETURNS
