/ACTUAL NUMBER OUTPUT ROUTINE

NUMOUT, HLT
	DCA NUMB	/SAVE IT
NUM01,	DCA NUMDGT	/CLEAR DIGIT COUNTER
	CLA CLL
	TAD NUMB	/GET CURRENT VALUE
	TAD I NUMOUT	/MINUS DIGIT BEING PRINTED.
	SNL		/DID IT OVERFLOW?
