/ROUTINE TO DECIDE CALLING MODE IN LIEU OF "SPECIAL MODE" PROBLEMS
/
PATCHF,	0
	SZA		/IS AC EMPTY
	JMP	RTN2	/NO-THIS IS ALWAYS SI MODE WITH ADDR IN AC
	TAD	FF	/YES-GET SPECIAL MODE FLIP-FLOP
