/ROUTINES TO BUMP ARGET AND FPUT POINTERS AND INCREMENT THE
/DATA FIELD IF THE POINTER CROSSES A FIELD BOUNDARY

ISZFGT,	0
	ISZ	FFGET	/BUMP POINTER
	JMP I	ISZFGT	/NO SKIP MEANS JUST RETURN
